    "title": "The second time in a day, a strong light occurred in the sun",
    "text": "Monday every day of the penultimate level is recorded in the sun. This has been reported at the Applied Geophysiology Institute Tass.\nIt should be noted that on Wednesday, September 24, at 22:13 Moscow's time within X -Ray in the group point 4224 (S12W49), a 25 -minute M1.6 flash was registered. Earlier, it was reported on the flash of M1.0.\nOn September 15, the strongest storm has collapsed to the ground for the past three months. The magnetic fluctuation level changes from the G3 to G2 layer. The magnetic disorder is caused by a large rim hole under the sun. In its power, the storm surpassed the initial calculations of the scientists.",
